# Title: Suspicious Download From Direct IP Via Bitsadmin
# ID: 99c840f2-2012-46fd-9141-c761987550ef
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Florian Roth (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2022-06-28
# Tags: attack.persistence, attack.execution, attack.stealth, attack.t1197, attack.s0190, attack.t1036.003
# Description: Detects usage of bitsadmin downloading a file using an URL that contains an IP
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((((process.command_line:*://1* OR process.command_line:*://2* OR process.command_line:*://3* OR process.command_line:*://4* OR process.command_line:*://5* OR process.command_line:*://6* OR process.command_line:*://7* OR process.command_line:*://8* OR process.command_line:*://9*)) AND ((process.command_line:* /transfer * OR process.command_line:* /create * OR process.command_line:* /addfile *)) AND ((process.executable:*\\bitsadmin.exe) OR (process.pe.original_file_name:"bitsadmin.exe"))) AND NOT ((process.command_line:*://7-*)))
